    {
      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To create the Python file for speaker diarization, I need to select a concrete external provider. I'll use the Google Cloud Speech-to-Text API for this task as it provides a robust service for speaker diarization. The code will include the necessary imports and authentication for the Google Cloud API, making it identifiable in the code. </thinking>\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789849398546,
          "start": 1789849395226
