      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To create the file `poll_transcription.py` that polls a transcription job and returns the transcript using a concrete external provider, I need to choose a specific service. Amazon Transcribe is a suitable choice for this task. I will import the necessary AWS SDK for Python (Boto3) and use the `transcribe` client to interact with Amazon Transcribe. The code will include the concrete model identifier or model family to make the provider identifiable. </thinking>\n",
